SUMMARY:Antiques Collector’s Home: Cash Only Sale: Fine Art\, Fine Furni
 ture\,Rugs\, Books\, China\, Etc!
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261106T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261106T153000
LOCATION:1 NEW STREET\, Mendham\, NJ 07945
DESCRIPTION:New Jersey Estate snd Moving Sales has the privilege of presen
 ting the three day sale of a noted local art and antiques collector. His 
 collections are vast and without question a rare public offering. CASH ON
 LY. NO pricing revealed prior to sale date. At the homeowner’s request\
 , this is a CASH ONLY sale. Please sign the list that will be posted at t
 he front gate starting at 8 AM Friday morning.\nThe works of the followin
 g artists are avaiable:\nWilliam E Baum\, George Nemethy\, Alice Judson\,
  Robert Loftin Newman\, Lucille Hobbie\, F W Loven\, Louis Saphier\, John
  Rollin Tilton\, William A Harper\, Victor de Grailly\, Will Hinds\, Leon
  Louis Dolce\, Leon Moran\, Daniel Charles Grose\, Arthur Faber\, etching
  by Dali “ Autumn”\, Bayard H Tyler\, Kenneth Smallwood\, Alfred De B
 reanski\, Hamilton Jay\, local artist Roger Flynn\, Dirck Stoop\, Fredric
 k Kost\, John Francis Murphy among others. No pricing revealed prior to s
 ale date.\nPeriod furniture such as English linen press\, Empire vanity\,
  English dressing table/stand\, several chests\, drop leaf and tilt top t
 ables\, game table\, 12 ft English dining table\, heavily carved inlaid s
 ideboard\, fabulous carved twin beds\, tiger maple ( Swedish?) chest of d
 rawers\, sleigh/day bed\, secretaries\, sewing stands\, etc.\nOf Special 
 Interest: Cityscape style table after Paul Evans\nBarometers by Preston a
 nd Tanger\, many religious artifacts\, polychrome sphinx\, large selectio
 n of African art and wood sculptures\, holy water fonts\, fireplace items
  including Richard Clancy duck andirons\, English and Asian tea caddies o
 utdoor metal sculptures by Heise\nNo pricing revealed prior to sale date.
  CASH ONLY.\nMany mirrors featuring one ornate circular convex mirror wit
 h carved laurel leaf motif and black ebonized inner rim.\nVintage and cur
 rent books on cooking\, gardening\, african art\, antique furniture\, ref
 erence\, silver\, auction catalugues\, etc.\nChina and crystal to include
  Green Derby Panel by Royal Crown Derby\, antique Derby pieces\, huge sel
 ection of Rose Medallion\, Fukagawa by Tiffany & Co\, Davenport Longport\
 , Adams Calyxware Lowestoft\, Wedgwood\, Minton\, Limoges\, Aynsley & Son
 s service plate\, large selection of Booths Old Willow\, Flow Blue Cashme
 re and more. Crystal including large sets of Tiffany Gilbert\, English Ho
 bnail\, Lenox and Mikasa\, etc.\nLamps and lighting to include cut crysta
 l candelabras\, sconces\, wooden bead chandelier\, brass lamps and lighti
 ng\, various other chandeliers\, Satsuma lamps\, etc.\nGilt bronze mantle
  clocks\, grandfather clock (as is)\, fine rugs\, etc.\nAddress will not 
 be revealed until two hours before the opening of sale. Absolutely no ear
 ly buying. No prices revealed before the sale. Please check back often as
  more descriptions and additional pictures will follow as we get closer t
 o the date of sale. We will ship for our out-of-state customers.Finally\,
  again please do not call for pricing. No pricing will be revealed before
  the sales date. CASH ONLY. Thank you.
URL:https://www.estatesales.net/NJ/Mendham/07945/5123361
